{"id":1040803,"chapter_id":1040803,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"狂风呼啸，沙土与碎石撞击着避难所的外壁，整栋建筑发出不祥的吱呀声音。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"content":"而你坐在室内的角落，尽可能将终端的收音口接近嘴部，好让声音清晰地传导出去。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"speaker":"局长","content":"……尽量远离沙暴中心，不要轻易出动救援……对，我这边暂时安全，等到沙暴结束后，我会重新联系你们。","style":2,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"content":"通讯终端的另一头，MBCC小队的声音断断续续，充满了沙沙的杂音。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"speaker":"特遣小队","content":"局长、太好<color=#7683a2><size=24><i>（沙沙）</color></size></i>……您没事就、好，小队也找到安全<color=#7683a2><size=24><i>（沙沙）</color></size></i>……我们遇到了一…<color=#7683a2><size=24><i>（沙沙）</color></size></i>……他们给我们指了路……","voice":["vo_trial_40803_1_5"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":11,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"content":"听筒另一侧的风声越来越大，在几秒杂音后，通讯突然切断。沙暴中的狂厄会干扰信号，你和外界彻底失联。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"content":"当然，你直接称我为“亲爱的”我也不会介意的，毕竟我们很快就能终成眷属了。也可以称我为伴侣，爱人，宝贝……只要你喜欢，叫什么都行。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"content":"一只手抚上你的后背，轻轻拍了几下。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803008,"trial_step":8},{"step":9,"options":["柯琳？"],"style":6,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803009,"trial_step":9,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"柯琳？","goto":10}]},{"step":10,"content":"但你抬头时，身边已经没了赏金猎人的身影。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803010,"trial_step":10},{"step":11,"content":"【回忆结束】","style":18,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803011,"trial_step":11},{"step":12,"speaker":"局长","content":"哎……","style":2,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803012,"trial_step":12},{"step":13,"content":"放下终端，转身看向房间——这里是一处航道附近的中型贸易所，通常负责账目清算与暂存货物，但为了抵抗砂海环境与砂盗袭击，也具有相当的防守与武力储备。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803013,"trial_step":13},{"step":14,"content":"只是四处的摆设已经损坏得不成样子，两扇窗户漏着窟窿，沙土正从缝隙中卷入房间。看起来这里已经荒废了有一段时间了。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803014,"trial_step":14},{"step":15,"options":["看看四周"],"style":6,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803015,"trial_step":15,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"看看四周","goto":16}]},{"step":16,"content":"你走向房间内的桌旁，已被打碎的咖啡杯内部充满了咖啡渍，看起来正是被喝了一半留在此处又被风干的样子。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803016,"trial_step":16},{"step":17,"content":"桌面上塞着几叠杂乱的账目文件，处理到一半的内容停在一个小数点旁，下一个数字已经变形，笔迹尾端拉长，在纸张上形成一道不自然的划线。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803017,"trial_step":17},{"step":18,"content":"……这些东西没有被取走，他们应该走得很突然。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803018,"trial_step":18},{"step":19,"speaker":"局长","content":"突发事件……但这里没有洗劫或者破坏的痕迹，不像是砂盗或是武力袭击……","style":2,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803019,"trial_step":19},{"step":20,"options":["难道是沙暴？"],"style":6,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803020,"trial_step":20,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"难道是沙暴？","goto":21}]},{"step":21,"speaker":"？？？","content":"bingo，被你猜中啦。","voice":["vo_trial_40803_1_21"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803021,"trial_step":21},{"step":22,"content":"熟悉的调侃声音在耳边响起。是刚刚突然消失的柯琳。她收起了长枪，取而代之的是手里不知从哪弄来的破旧毛毯、应急食品和一只工具箱。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803022,"trial_step":22},{"step":23,"options":["你去哪了？","我以为你已经溜走了"],"style":6,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803023,"trial_step":23,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"你去哪了？","goto":24},{"text":"我以为你已经溜走了","goto":25}]},{"step":24,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"去找点生活物资。这个地方偶尔会有人来落脚，砂海的规矩，放在避难所里的东西都可以拿，但也得给后面再来的家伙留点东西。","voice":["vo_trial_40803_1_24"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803024,"trial_step":24,"next":[26]},{"step":25,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"哎呀，我也想走啊……可惜，在沙暴里七进七出之类的故事只能骗骗小孩儿，就算是我也不敢一个人硬闯沙暴。","voice":["vo_trial_40803_1_25"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803025,"trial_step":25},{"step":26,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"喏，先把毯子披上，沙暴还不知道多久才能停，降温后会很冷的。","voice":["vo_trial_40803_1_26"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803026,"trial_step":26},{"step":27,"options":["你好像对这里很熟？"],"style":6,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803027,"trial_step":27,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"你好像对这里很熟？","goto":28}]},{"step":28,"speaker":"局长","content":"这到底是哪？为什么会变成这样？","style":2,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803028,"trial_step":28},{"step":29,"content":"她把毛毯扔给你，又递给你一瓶水，接着拎着工具箱走向正在漏风的窗户，边走边说。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803029,"trial_step":29},{"step":30,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"如你所见，这地方原本是个交易枢纽站，但被一场超大规模的灰烬之潮彻底弄了个底朝天。","voice":["vo_trial_40803_1_30"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803030,"trial_step":30},{"step":31,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"那些年久失修的防卫设施在沙暴面前什么都挡不住，唯一好运的就是他们有两艘砂艇，靠着异方晶储备和砂艇逃命，在这儿工作的大部分打工仔都没事儿。","voice":["vo_trial_40803_1_31"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803031,"trial_step":31},{"step":32,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"不过……我听说后来他们因为私自挪用异方晶吃了官司，具体结局我就不清楚了。","voice":["vo_trial_40803_1_32"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803032,"trial_step":32},{"step":33,"options":["灰烬之潮？"],"style":6,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803033,"trial_step":33,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"灰烬之潮？","goto":34}]},{"step":34,"speaker":"局长","content":"超大规模的灰烬之潮？这是什么时候的事？","style":2,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803034,"trial_step":34},{"step":35,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"我想想啊，就是近一年内的事情，刚好也和你们狄斯的某件大事儿挨着呢……","voice":["vo_trial_40803_1_35"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803035,"trial_step":35},{"step":36,"content":"用力将一条长木板钉在窗框上，柯琳回头看向你，眼神闪烁。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803036,"trial_step":36},{"step":37,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"——比如，那只爆发在辛迪加的<color=#fb9259>黑环</color>。真是巧啊，亲爱的局长，你知道这之间有什么关联吗？","voice":["vo_trial_40803_1_37"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803037,"trial_step":37},{"step":38,"content":"室内一片死寂。柯琳站在黑暗中，帽檐低垂，你看不清她的表情，只觉得她的视线上下扫视过你，似乎想要透过你挖掘出更深层的秘密。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803038,"trial_step":38},{"step":39,"content":"但相比之下，她话语中透露出的信息更让你不寒而栗——BR-002和灰烬之潮？砂海的异动加剧难道与黑环有关？","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803039,"trial_step":39},{"step":40,"content":"以及……难道说，柯琳绑架海拉、借机靠近你的理由，也和这个有关？","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803040,"trial_step":40},{"step":41,"content":"但你还没回话，柯琳先叹了声气。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803041,"trial_step":41},{"step":42,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"好吧，看你一脸茫然的表情，估计你也不知道。","voice":["vo_trial_40803_1_42"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803042,"trial_step":42},{"step":43,"content":"她转身走回来，像是想起了什么，回身在兜中摸索几下。掏出什么东西向你抛了过来。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803043,"trial_step":43},{"step":44,"content":"下意识伸手去接，沉甸甸的触感砸在手心，你低头查看。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803044,"trial_step":44},{"step":45,"options":["这是糖？"],"style":6,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803045,"trial_step":45,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"这是糖？","goto":46}]},{"step":46,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"是一点小贿赂。放心，是干净的，唯一的问题是过期了——不过也才十来天，问题不大。","voice":["vo_trial_40803_1_46"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803046,"trial_step":46},{"step":47,"content":"柯琳也掏出一颗一样的糖果，拆掉包装塞进嘴里，然后径直走过来坐在你身边。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803047,"trial_step":47},{"step":48,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"好啦，表情别这么严肃。我对你没有敌意，只是想问问狄斯上头的大老爷们，看看自己的推测到底有没有半点准头。","voice":["vo_trial_40803_1_48"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803048,"trial_step":48},{"step":49,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"可惜找错人咯，你也不知道。","voice":["vo_trial_40803_1_49"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803049,"trial_step":49},{"step":50,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"我认栽，对不起啊，把你也牵扯进沙暴里了。","voice":["vo_trial_40803_1_50"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803050,"trial_step":50},{"step":51,"content":"女人坦率地道歉，和此前所有带着调笑的话语不同，她这次的语气极为真诚。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803051,"trial_step":51},{"step":52,"content":"蜥蜴“警长”不疾不徐，绕过她的脖子爬到了另一侧肩头与你对视，眨眨眼，似乎也在表达歉意。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803052,"trial_step":52},{"step":53,"options":["你确实该道歉","这道歉来得有点晚"],"style":6,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803053,"trial_step":53,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"你确实该道歉","goto":54},{"text":"这道歉来得有点晚","goto":null}]},{"step":54,"content":"但比起道歉，你对她刚刚说的另一个话题更感兴趣。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803054,"trial_step":54},{"step":55,"speaker":"局长","content":"除了这个“推测”外，你还知道什么？","style":2,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803055,"trial_step":55},{"step":56,"speaker":"局长","content":"沙暴或者灰烬之潮的加剧，无人管理的航道贸易点……这些都是远在狄斯的我看不到的东西。砂海或许未来还会有什么新的威胁，但我看不到，知道这些的只有你。","style":2,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803056,"trial_step":56},{"step":57,"speaker":"局长","content":"柯琳，你在担忧什么？你到底看到了什么？","style":2,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803057,"trial_step":57},{"step":58,"content":"你看着柯琳，终于察觉到她的表情出现了一丝裂痕。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803058,"trial_step":58},{"step":59,"speaker":"局长","content":"你也察觉到了……有什么东西正在行动，是吗？","style":2,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803059,"trial_step":59},{"step":60,"content":"最后一句话落地，柯琳沉默了一会儿，终于放弃似的出声。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803060,"trial_step":60},{"step":61,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"好吧，能言善辩的混蛋——吃了我给的糖，嗓子好了，就找我刨根问底起来了，真没良心。","voice":["vo_trial_40803_1_61"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803061,"trial_step":61},{"step":62,"content":"年轻的赏金猎人撑起身子，坐了起来。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803062,"trial_step":62},{"step":63,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"只是最近发生的事情……和一些奇怪的往事对应了起来。","voice":["vo_trial_40803_1_63"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803063,"trial_step":63},{"step":64,"content":"<i>在很久之前……那时候沙暴的频率还没那么高，我也没有成为禁闭者。在不开张的日子里，偶然能接到一些讨伐或者找人的委托。</i>","style":3,"background":2297,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803064,"trial_step":64},{"step":65,"content":"<i>委托的内容五花八门，委托人的身份也各有不同。在砂海混的大多都是挣一份糊口钱，大家也不会有多在意委托人的身份。</i>","style":3,"background":2297,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803065,"trial_step":65},{"step":66,"content":"<i>……只是，那天的委托人尤为诡异。</i>","style":3,"background":2297,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803066,"trial_step":66},{"step":67,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"我已经把你要的东西送过去了。只是……你们报酬给的这么大方？刚刚送的不会是什么要被治安队盯上的违禁品吧？","voice":["vo_trial_40803_1_67"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":2297,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803067,"trial_step":67},{"step":68,"speaker":"面目不清的黑衣人","content":"无需紧张，年轻人。","voice":["vo_trial_40803_1_68"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":2297,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803068,"trial_step":68},{"step":69,"speaker":"面目不清的黑衣人","content":"我们并非怀有恶意，也不会让你惹上麻烦……只是想与你交个朋友。","voice":["vo_trial_40803_1_69"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":2297,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803069,"trial_step":69},{"step":70,"content":"<i>交易结束，那个黑衣人礼貌性地伸出手，我也礼貌性地握回去。这人的手很冷，也很僵硬。</i>","style":3,"background":2297,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803070,"trial_step":70},{"step":71,"speaker":"面目不清的黑衣人","content":"相信你，总有一天会感激今天拿到的这份“报酬”……","voice":["vo_trial_40803_1_71"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":2297,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803071,"trial_step":71},{"step":72,"content":"【黑屏】（回忆滤镜）","style":18,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803072,"trial_step":72},{"step":73,"speaker":"面目不清的黑衣人","content":"再见，柯琳小姐。<color=#fb9259>交易愉快</color>。","voice":["vo_trial_40803_1_73"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803073,"trial_step":73},{"step":74,"content":"<i>奇怪的顾客，奇怪的委托，不明所以的报酬。后来随着时间推移，我逐渐将这个人抛至脑后，直到——</i>","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803074,"trial_step":74},{"step":75,"speaker":"莱特","content":"柯琳？！柯琳你干什么、咳咳——快跑！","voice":["vo_trial_40803_1_75"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803075,"trial_step":75},{"step":76,"content":"<i>突如其来的沙暴。此前砂海从未出现过如此大规模的突发性沙暴。图科的移动需要时间，所以我留下殿后。</i>","style":3,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803076,"trial_step":76},{"step":77,"content":"<i>当然，还好留下殿后的只有我一个人——几乎是在船队离开的下一秒，风沙就吞没了一切。也包括留在最后的我。</i>","style":3,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803077,"trial_step":77},{"step":78,"content":"<i>在混沌中，一切感官都变得模糊，除了从手部传来的灼热感受。那份热感从指尖传来，越来越烫，几乎到了难以忍受的程度，然后——</i>","style":3,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803078,"trial_step":78},{"step":79,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"然后，等我醒来的时候，自己已经被包扎成木乃伊的样子躺在图科船上了。","voice":["vo_trial_40803_1_80"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803080,"trial_step":80},{"step":80,"content":"柯琳若有所思地看着自己的指尖。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803081,"trial_step":81},{"step":81,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"我后来才反应过来，那种烫人的异常感就是“狂厄”。我被灰烬之潮中的狂厄感染，变成了你们口中的禁闭者。","voice":["vo_trial_40803_1_82"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803082,"trial_step":82},{"step":82,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"……我不知道当初的那个人是谁，但他们一定在谋划着什么，我能在那场沙暴中幸存也绝非巧合。","voice":["vo_trial_40803_1_83"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803083,"trial_step":83},{"step":83,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"世界在迅速变化。如今砂海越来越乱了，异方晶提价、涅槃独占航道，沙暴也在失控升级。我们本就没多少生存空间，如果还有别的乱子……","voice":["vo_trial_40803_1_84"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803084,"trial_step":84},{"step":84,"speaker":"局长","content":"但以你的能力，进入狄斯躲避危机不算太难。","style":2,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803085,"trial_step":85},{"step":85,"content":"柯琳轻轻笑了笑，但话里却不见轻松。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803086,"trial_step":86},{"step":86,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"但图科就没这么容易了，不是吗？","voice":["vo_trial_40803_1_87"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803087,"trial_step":87},{"step":87,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"你调查过图科，镇里几乎没有青壮年，大部分都是老人、孩子、战斗力不足的病秧子，总之都是狄斯容不下的人。","voice":["vo_trial_40803_1_88"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803088,"trial_step":88},{"step":88,"content":"似乎是想起了那些熟悉的面孔，柯琳的声音带着笑意。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803089,"trial_step":89},{"step":89,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"我们本就是靠着坑蒙拐骗活下来的，但能这么继续活多久？谁也不知道，谁也没法保证。","voice":["vo_trial_40803_1_90"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803090,"trial_step":90},{"step":90,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"更何况，砂海里有那么多个图科这样的地方……他们或许连发生了什么都不清楚，就被沙暴给埋了。没人听到他们的声音，甚至没人会记得他们。","voice":["vo_trial_40803_1_91"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803091,"trial_step":91},{"step":91,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"所以，我选择主动出击，“钓”一个看起来会知情的狄斯佬出来打探打探消息——","voice":["vo_trial_40803_1_92"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803093,"trial_step":92},{"step":92,"content":"目光扫向你，她的意思不言而喻。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803094,"trial_step":93},{"step":93,"options":["我就是那个倒霉的狄斯佬？"],"style":6,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803095,"trial_step":94,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"我就是那个倒霉的狄斯佬？","goto":95}]},{"step":94,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"猜对咯，亲爱的~","voice":["vo_trial_40803_1_95"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803096,"trial_step":95},{"step":95,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"多亏了小海拉，最开始的时候还以为她在吹牛，但没想到她真的和MBCC关系不浅。她是个善良的好姑娘，她那么信任那么喜欢的“笨蛋局长”，应该也是个心善嘴软的好人——","voice":["vo_trial_40803_1_96"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803097,"trial_step":96},{"step":96,"speaker":"局长","content":"于是你就下了个套，用绑架海拉为钩子把我钓到了砂海。","style":2,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803098,"trial_step":97},{"step":97,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"是啊，只是没想到这位局长大人真是一点都不省心，竟然追着我一起跳船跳出来了！要是有个三长两短，小老鼠该跳回来敲我水管咯……","voice":["vo_trial_40803_1_98"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803099,"trial_step":98},{"step":98,"options":["彼此彼此"],"style":6,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803100,"trial_step":99,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"彼此彼此","goto":100}]},{"step":99,"speaker":"柯琳","content":"嗯？","voice":["vo_trial_40803_1_100"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803101,"trial_step":100},{"step":100,"speaker":"局长","content":"你不也是吗？关心则乱，你偷偷从图科溜出来，想一个人把事情摆平……我们彼此彼此吧。","style":2,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803102,"trial_step":101},{"step":101,"speaker":"局长","content":"一个人什么也不说冲进险境……我之前也干过这样的事情，但这只会让留下的人更加煎熬，不是什么好方法。","style":2,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803103,"trial_step":102},{"step":102,"speaker":"局长","content":"虽然出发点是好的，但……","style":2,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803104,"trial_step":103},{"step":103,"content":"但却忘了，正因为逆境艰难命运未卜，才需要和同伴一起担负。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803105,"trial_step":104},{"step":104,"speaker":"局长","content":"我可以向你分享部分情报。但相对的，我相信你那些同伴也不希望自己被蒙在鼓里。","style":2,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803106,"trial_step":105},{"step":105,"speaker":"局长","content":"没有人该死在砂海，或者被埋在这种不讲道理的沙暴里。至少你们该知道自己要面对的是什么。","style":2,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803107,"trial_step":106},{"step":106,"speaker":"局长","content":"至于耍帅和逞强——","style":2,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803108,"trial_step":107},{"step":107,"content":"你看着面前的赏金猎人，也忍不住调侃一句。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803109,"trial_step":108},{"step":108,"speaker":"局长","content":"还是留给海拉吧，她会更吃这一套的。","style":2,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803110,"trial_step":109},{"step":109,"content":"柯琳愣了楞，似乎想反驳什么，但被突如其来的巨响打断。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803111,"trial_step":110},{"step":110,"content":"砰砰！大门的方向传来巨大的撞击声。柯琳头一回露出惊诧的神色，她似乎看到了什么本不该出现在这里的东西——","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803112,"trial_step":111},{"step":111,"content":"下一秒，固定门扉的金属锁不堪重负，飞溅崩断，大门砰地开启，砸在墙壁上。一群黑压压的影子高声叫喊着，风一般的扑向你们。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803114,"trial_step":112},{"step":112,"speaker":"？？？","content":"柯琳——你这个混蛋，我今天非得把你的头拧下来不可！！！","voice":["vo_trial_40803_1_113"],"voice_bank":"vo_korryn_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140803115,"trial_step":113}]}